      observation: "Try one hour of real silence. Notice how the heart looks for talk to rest in.",
      sourceAnchor: "Book 22, part 11, the conditions of the aspirant: The aspirant's handhold, the guide, and his fortress of solitude, silence, hunger and wakefulness.",
